    "C_K_G": "1 + Σ|g_i| + Σ_{i<j}|g_i|×|g_j|  (K=1: 1+Σ|g_i|; K=2: +Σ_{i<j}|g_i|×|g_j|)",
    "note": "Enumerated count includes redundant original-state evaluations (1 + |G| + C(|G|,2) for K=2). Minimal non-redundant count = 1 + Σ(|g_i|-1) + Σ_{i<j}(|g_i|-1)(|g_j|-1). Both are idempotent under AND semantics."
  },
